flowchart TD
    A([Reporting line changes])
    --> B[Employee now has direct reports]
    --> C[Re-evaluate groups using direct-report criteria]
    --> D{Matches Manager-oriented Group?}

    D -- No --> E([No change])
    D -- Yes --> F[Add Group membership]
    --> G[Receive assigned Manager Role]
    --> H[Apply configured Scope]
    --> I([Access updated])
